      "writtenOn": "2018-10-05T08:14:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note to self: in static void lpc_s0ix_suspend_clear_masks(void), when we enter S01x, we are cleaing the SCI mask. Won\u0027t that prevent the AP from receiving sensor interrupt when the CPU is [pseudo]sleeping when there are no GPIO between AP and EC?",
